// Book Four, Chapter 3 (session 41). The first Friday of March 1860: supper at the river house, and a night in the city.
// Opens with no phase (the answer to the card, the supper and the Compact), a short hunger scene that only runs if must_feed() is true on entry, then one night phase of three actions out of four, and a letter at dawn.
